          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater effective control over the Strait increases inspection, hold‑ups and risk premia on shipments of fuels and chemical precursors transiting the route, reducing immediately accessible imports of inputs used in high‑tech manufacturing." />
