          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A surge in drone attacks creates urgent demand for counter-UAS, autonomous sensing, and AI-enabled targeting/defense systems, which redirects venture and defense capital into AI startups and procurement programs." />
