          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher resilience (diversified, audited vendors and rapid replacement paths) reduces reliance on fragile third-party providers and single points of failure that attackers exploit, lowering the frequency and impact of supply-chain and model-targeted cyber incidents." />
