          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Reduced resilience in tech and parts supply chains for refineries and offshore production (spare parts, control electronics) increases unplanned outages and limits run‑rates, tightening refined‑product and crude demand/supply balance and pushing up global oil prices." />
