          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained rises in global oil prices raise Russia's real-time export receipts and budget flexibility even at stable volumes, enabling political leaders and commanders to finance operations and sustain losses, which increases political and operational pressure to pursue stronger military options rather than de‑escalate." />
