          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A reduction in available maritime transit capacity (through chokepoint congestion, convoy restrictions or port closures) immediately lowers throughput and creates bottlenecks that amplify and prolong trade disruptions affecting Ukrainian exports and regional shipping." />
