          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid conversion of navigation, scheduling and terminal-automation models into commercial tools increases automated berth allocation and voyage optimization adoption, raising effective shipment throughput at ports and on routes." />
